/// M06 CORE-040 "bundled streams: pump roots green, three assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/streams_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledStreams (L196-339).
/// Related fixture: the inline streamsPumpProgram const (L18-57), staged
/// as src/main.can at L233; every count pin below grounds an assert arm
/// in that program (pump 2, main 1; total 3).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 3 roots, grounded per function in the pump program. The
/// pull-loop transcript values (end 5 => ok 5, more 0 => ok 2) replay
/// FIFO across recursion (L259) and are recorded in the facet map; the
/// count pins below anchor the green shape.
/// Live runtime cases, the live tree leg, transcript bounds and the four
/// rejections live in core-040-streams-semantics.can; the production
/// process shape lives in core-040-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the 11 runtime cases, live
/// tree, transcript over/underrun and four rejection programs live in the
/// streams-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/WORK/PROC/N1
/// and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 180000ms mirrors the Go 3-minute ctx (L202).
/// Delegated oracles: none in this file (DELEGATE-021 belongs to the
/// streams-semantics file).
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case streams/pump-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, pump-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (streams_test.go legs): assert-green pins the pump assert leg
/// (L261-264: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the pump report leg (L269: passed true); root-count
/// pins the three roots (L269: len assertions is 3); fixture-name grounds
/// the pins in the staged program (L233: src/main.can); pump-roots pins
/// pump (L26-28: end/more, 2 roots; end 5 => ok 5 drains the empty
/// transcript, more 0 => ok 2 replays ["a","b"] then [] FIFO);
/// main-roots pins main (L54-55: sample => ok, 1 root).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
record context
    str case_id
    str variant_id
    str workspace
    str run_id
record check
    str id
    str title
record check_ref
    str id
record expected_check
